---
import { t, type Lang } from "../i18n";

interface Props {
    lang: Lang;
}

const { lang } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="w-full bg-white pt-10 lg:pt-[120px]">
    <div class="max-w-container mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-5 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 lg:gap-5">
            <div
                class="col-span-full flex flex-col gap-[72px] pb-10 lg:pb-[120px] border-b border-divider"
            >
                <div
                    class="text-[14px] leading-[1.25] tracking-[0.03em] text-gray-2 max-w-[900px]"
                >
                    {
                        lang === "es" ? (
                            <p>
                                *Las tasas son anuales y fijas durante el plazo
                                invertido, sujetas a las condiciones imperantes
                                en el momento de su contratación. Consulte la
                                vigencia de la oferta, requisitos e información
                                sobre la contratación o características de los
                                productos en{" "}
                                <a href="http://kapital.com/" class="underline">
                                    kapital.com
                                </a>
                                . Tasa fija bruta anual <strong>8.50%</strong>
                                <strong>GAT NOMINAL 8.50%</strong> y{" "}
                                <strong>GAT REAL 4.15%</strong>, antes de
                                impuestos, calculados al 27 de agosto de 2026
                                sobre un rango de inversión de{" "}
                                <strong>$1,000.00 MXN a $49,999.99 MXN</strong>,
                                a un plazo de 360 días, vigente hasta el 30 de
                                septiembre de 2026. Para fines informativos y de
                                comparación. La GAT Real es el rendimiento que
                                obtendría después de descontar la inflación
                                estimada.{" "}
                                <strong>
                                    La contratación está sujeta al cumplimiento
                                    del perfil de cliente y condiciones de
                                    elegibilidad consultables en
                                </strong>
                                <a href="http://kapital.com/" class="underline">
                                    kapital.com
                                </a>
                            </p>
                        ) : lang === "en" ? (
                            <p>
                                *Rates are annual and fixed during the
                                investment term, subject to prevailing
                                conditions at the time of contracting. Check the
                                offer validity, requirements and information
                                about contracting or product features at{" "}
                                <a href="http://kapital.com/" class="underline">
                                    kapital.com
                                </a>
                                . Gross annual fixed rate <strong>8.50%</strong>
                                <strong>GROSS APY 8.50%</strong> and{" "}
                                <strong>REAL APY 4.15%</strong>, before taxes,
                                calculated as of August 27, 2026 on an
                                investment range of{" "}
                                <strong>$1,000.00 MXN to $49,999.99 MXN</strong>
                                , for a 360-day term, valid until September 30,
                                2026. For informational and comparison purposes.
                                Real APY is the return you would obtain after
                                deducting estimated inflation.{" "}
                                <strong>
                                    Contracting is subject to compliance with
                                    the client profile and eligibility
                                    conditions available at
                                </strong>
                                <a href="http://kapital.com/" class="underline">
                                    kapital.com
                                </a>
                            </p>
                        ) : (
                            <p>
                                *Les taux sont annuels et fixes pendant la durée
                                de l'investissement, sous réserve des conditions
                                en vigueur au moment de la souscription.
                                Consultez la validité de l'offre, les exigences
                                et les informations sur la souscription ou les
                                caractéristiques des produits sur{" "}
                                <a href="http://kapital.com/" class="underline">
                                    kapital.com
                                </a>
                                . Taux fixe brut annuel <strong>8,50 %</strong>
                                <strong>TAR NOMINAL 8,50 %</strong> et{" "}
                                <strong>TAR RÉEL 4,15 %</strong>, avant impôts,
                                calculés au 27 août 2026 sur une plage
                                d'investissement de{" "}
                                <strong>1 000,00 MXN à 49 999,99 MXN</strong>,
                                pour une durée de 360 jours, valable jusqu'au 30
                                septembre 2026. À des fins informatives et de
                                comparaison. Le TAR réel est le rendement que
                                vous obtiendriez après déduction de l'inflation
                                estimée.{" "}
                                <strong>
                                    La souscription est soumise au respect du
                                    profil client et des conditions
                                    d'éligibilité consultables sur
                                </strong>
                                <a href="http://kapital.com/" class="underline">
                                    kapital.com
                                </a>
                            </p>
                        )
                    }

                    <p class="mt-4">{t(lang, "legal.termsTitle")}</p>
                    <p class="mt-2">{t(lang, "legal.clientProfile")}</p>
                    <p class="mt-2">{t(lang, "legal.eligibility")}</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    const lerp = (start: number, end: number, t: number) =>
        start + (end - start) * t;

    function initMarquees() {
        document
            .querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-partners-track]")
            .forEach((track) => {
                const container = track.parentElement;
                const group = track.querySelector<HTMLElement>(
                    "[data-partners-group]",
                );
                if (!container || !group || !track) return;

                const state = {
                    raf: 0,
                    x: 0,
                    speed: 0,
                    targetSpeed: 0,
                    loopWidth: 0,
                    lastTime: 0,
                    isPaused: false,
                    isInView: false,
                };

                const getGap = (): number => {
                    const style = window.getComputedStyle(track);
                    return parseFloat(style.columnGap || style.gap || "0") || 0;
                };

                const getSpeed = (): number =>
                    window.matchMedia("(min-width: 768px)").matches ? 102 : 84;

                const cloneGroup = (): HTMLElement => {
                    const clone = group.cloneNode(true) as HTMLElement;
                    clone.removeAttribute("data-partners-group");
                    clone.setAttribute("data-partners-clone", "");
                    clone.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");
                    clone
                        .querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>("a")
                        .forEach((a) => {
                            a.tabIndex = -1;
                        });
                    return clone;
                };

                const setup = () => {
                    track
                        .querySelectorAll("[data-partners-clone]")
                        .forEach((c) => c.remove());
                    const gap = getGap();
                    state.loopWidth = group.scrollWidth + gap;
                    if (!state.loopWidth) return;

                    let totalWidth = group.scrollWidth;
                    const viewportWidth =
                        container.offsetWidth + state.loopWidth;
                    while (totalWidth < viewportWidth) {
                        track.appendChild(cloneGroup());
                        totalWidth += state.loopWidth;
                    }
                    state.x = state.x % state.loopWidth;
                    track.style.transform = `translate3d(${-state.x}px, 0, 0)`;
                };

                const updateTargetSpeed = () => {
                    state.targetSpeed = state.isPaused ? 0 : getSpeed();
                };

                const setPaused = (paused: boolean) => {
                    state.isPaused = paused;
                    updateTargetSpeed();
                };

                const animate = (time: number) => {
                    const dt = state.lastTime
                        ? (time - state.lastTime) / 1000
                        : 0;
                    state.lastTime = time;
                    updateTargetSpeed();
                    state.speed = lerp(state.speed, state.targetSpeed, 0.05);

                    if (state.loopWidth) {
                        state.x =
                            (state.x + state.speed * dt) % state.loopWidth;
                        track.style.transform = `translate3d(${-state.x}px, 0, 0)`;
                    }
                    state.raf = requestAnimationFrame(animate);
                };

                const start = () => {
                    if (!state.raf) {
                        state.lastTime = 0;
                        state.raf = requestAnimationFrame(animate);
                    }
                };

                const stop = () => {
                    if (state.raf) {
                        cancelAnimationFrame(state.raf);
                        state.raf = 0;
                        state.lastTime = 0;
                    }
                };

                setup();
                setPaused(false);

                if ("IntersectionObserver" in window) {
                    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
                        ([entry]) => {
                            state.isInView = entry?.isIntersecting ?? false;
                            if (state.isInView) {
                                setup();
                                start();
                            } else {
                                stop();
                            }
                        },
                        { rootMargin: "200px 0px", threshold: 0 },
                    );
                    observer.observe(container);
                } else {
                    state.isInView = true;
                    start();
                }

                container.addEventListener("mouseenter", () => setPaused(true));
                container.addEventListener("mouseleave", () =>
                    setPaused(false),
                );
                container.addEventListener("focusin", () => setPaused(true));
                container.addEventListener("focusout", () => setPaused(false));
                window.addEventListener("resize", setup);
            });
    }

    if (document.readyState === "loading") {
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", initMarquees, {
            once: true,
        });
    } else {
        initMarquees();
    }
</script>
